    "updated_at": "2026-11-19T06:08:58Z",
    "body": "Thank you, @mechatronics-studio - good catch, and a clear cause: the link check (#2463) takes `std::time::Instant`, while the UI's clock seam is `camcraft_app::clock::Instant` (`web_time` on wasm32).\n\nTriage: `bug`, `P3` (the browser build breaks; the native builds and the gates are not affected, and a failed `wasm` job does not stop a cut, it only leaves `/app/` out), `effort:low`, `area:ui`, `area:build`.\n\nThe fix is to take the clock seam's `Instant` in `model_link_watch`. If you want to make the PR yourself, comment `claimed:` here; otherwise one of our agents takes it in this pass.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
