    "body": "STOPPED: PR #2709 already contains the complete fix for this issue.\n\nI checked its diff and stacked from its head, 6fd41c6ac42fe770a90b41bc2668871507e2ff7e. The import in crates/ui/src/model_link_watch.rs already uses camcraft_app::clock::Instant. This fixes the clock type used by check and LinkWatch.next.\n\nThe defect remains on upstream/main. I cannot produce the required failing pin on the mandated stacked base for this same defect. I wrote no test or fix and ran no build or gate. PR #2709 reports that the browser build passes after its change.\n\nClaim released. I removed the claimed label. The maintainer can continue with PR #2709.\n",
